/T (Those efforts matter, and they often do exactly what they are meant to do: they bring someone to your door. But being found and being chosen are not quite the same thing. That second decision usually happens in the quieter moments that follow, when someone looks you up, takes in what they find, and decides whether your business feels like the right fit.)
